# Google Places API Configuration
# Get your API key from: https://console.cloud.google.com/

# IMPORTANT: Replace YOUR_API_KEY_HERE with your actual Google Places API key
# The key should start with: AIzaSy...
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=YOUR_API_KEY_HERE

# Instructions to get your API key:
# 1. Go to: https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Create a new project (or select existing)
# 3. Click "APIs & Services" â†’ "Library"
# 4. Search and enable "Places API" (NOT Maps SDK)
# 5. Click "APIs & Services" â†’ "Credentials"
# 6. Click "Create Credentials" â†’ "API Key"
# 7. Copy the key and paste it above
# 8. IMPORTANT: Enable billing (you get  free credit per month)
# 9. Restart your app with: npx expo start --clear
